      "blocks": {
        "greview_01": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "5",
            "text": "Lovely Incense Sticks and Cups with a Smooth, Pleasant aroma. No eye irritation and not overpowering, making it perfect for daily use. Packaging is also Neat and Safe and Smart.",
            "author": "Pinkesh Kumar",
            "date": ""
          }
        },
        "greview_02": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "5",
            "text": "I have so far used the Dasangam havan cups and I have to admit it's the best that I have come across thus far. I can't wait to experience the other two variants- floral and lemongrass.\nI only had an initial hiccup with their courier partner which they promptly took care of after I escalated the matter.\nKeep it up and all the very best.",
            "author": "Partho Ghosh",
            "date": ""
          }
        },
        "greview_03": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "5",
            "text": "Excellent quality. I have ordered multiple times since the aroma is so subtle and divine. Very genuine product",
            "author": "Padmaja K",
            "date": ""
          }
        },
        "greview_04": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "5",
            "text": "We just tried once at home and found that High-quality, clean burns, natural aromas, and long-lasting scents. It's really worth. At first I saw these products and thought that it's a routine but after use I came to know that the doop sticks and doop cups and all are made by purely natural ingredients. My overall rating is 5 out of 5. Highly recommended. And packing is awesome",
            "author": "Balaji Kanthi Nag.B",
            "date": ""
          }
        },
        "greview_05": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "5",
            "text": "Excellent product. It creates a serene ambience which greatly enhances the concentration of the mind towards prayer.",
            "author": "Sankaran Anantharaman",
            "date": ""
          }
        },
        "greview_06": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "5",
            "text": "Recently tried some products from STOMATAL FARMS and really liked them.\n\nThe incense sticks (Dasangam and Lemongrass) had a very pleasant and calming fragrance. Both felt natural and refreshing.\n\nAlso tried their moringa powder blend with 70% Moringa powder and 30% curry leaves—it feels healthy, natural, and good quality.\n\nOverall, a nice experience with their products. 🌿",
            "author": "Rakesh Pandian",
            "date": ""
          }
        },
        "greview_07": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "5",
            "text": "Very nice product i have come across…made with natural ingredients and the smoke is very mild and spreads a positive vibe around the home😇",
            "author": "nandhini karthikeyan",
            "date": ""
          }
        },
        "greview_08": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": "5",
