          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Why cow dung?",
            "heading": "What is cow dung incense?",
            "highlight_type": "underline",
            "heading_base_size": 80,
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "text": "<p>For centuries, Indian homes have burned dried desi cow dung (gomaya) in yagnas and homams to purify the air. Aurora uses the same purified, solar-dried cow dung – mixed with herbs, resins and natural extracts – instead of charcoal and bamboo.</p><p>It is <strong>odourless once dried</strong>, burns slowly and evenly, and leaves an ash you can use as vibhuti or plant fertiliser. Every purchase also supports cow welfare and rescue.</p>",
